			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 762000801,
					"content": "Silly cat... where on earth are you— Oh! You found it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000802,
					"content": "It got trapped in those Twinleaf Pitcher Plants over there. They're plants, yes, but they're carnivorous, and can digest Moonglow Fireflies in just a few days...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000803,
					"content": "Good thing we found it in time. It's just a little weak now, but if we'd been any later... who knows what might've happened.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000804,
					"content": "G—Goodness... That's dangerous...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jukka"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000805,
					"content": "Hmph, can't blame anyone but yourself for crawling in there, silly cat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000806,
					"content": "Well, it's not really the cat's fault. These Twinleaf Pitcher Plants give off a special scent. Humans aren't affected, but insects and other little creatures might get drawn in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000807,
					"content": "That's how the plants catch their prey. There's an unusual number of pitcher plants here, small animals are affected by their presence too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000808,
					"content": "Oh... I see. Anyway, having this many of these plants grow here is definitely not a good sign, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000809,
					"content": "That's right. If we leave them alone, they could cause some real trouble...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Linnea"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000810,
					"content": "Alright, then we'll handle the weeding. Jukka, come help too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000811,
					"content": "These plants made our silly cat suffer so much. We have to return the favor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000812,
					"content": "With the help of the two treasure hunters, the unusual overgrowth of Twinleaf Pitcher Plants in the area is finally cleared...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762000813,
					"content": "Phew... we're finally done. Time to head back to Nasha Town. Thanks a lot, miss, for helping us find this silly cat. If it weren't for your help, who knows how long it would've been trapped.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000814,
					"content": "Come to think of it, Marja, if you hadn't yelled so loudly earlier, we might have found it even sooner...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jukka"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000815,
					"content": "Wh—What are you talking about? Anyway, the important thing is it's safe now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762000816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marja"
				},
				{
					"id": 762000816,
